			"notes": "## ⚔️ Vanilla+ Arsenal\n**Netherite Tier Guns**  \n- **Netherite Shotgun**: 5-projectile spread + Slime bullet compatible  \n- **Netherite Sniper**: 1.5× headshot multiplier + High velocity  \n- **Netherite Gatling**: Rapid-fire + Fire-resistant  \n\n## 🔥 Ice and Fire Integration\n**Dragonsteel Series**  \n- *3 Weapon Types*: Shotgun/Sniper/Gatling  \n- *3 Elements*: Fire (Ignition), Ice (Freeze), Lightning (Chain)  \n- Crafted in **Dragon Forge** using dragon blood  \n- Special Bullets: Dragonsteel-tipped (Elemental effects)  \n\n## ☄️ Cataclysm Tech-weapons  \n- **Cursium Sniper**: Auto-tracking bullets (Phases walls)  \n- **Ignitium Gatling**: Health-steal & infinite ammo cycle  \n- **Lavapower Shotgun**: Magma splash (Terrain burning)  \n- Ammo Types: Cursed/Ignited/Molten cores  \n\n## ⚙️ Features  \n- Full configs \n\n**Requires**:  \n- Guns Without Roses\n- Ice and Fire ≥2.1.13  (Optional)  \n- Cataclysm ≥2.3.1 (Optional)"
